    definition: "Drawing conclusions from a sample that contains only the cases that passed a selection, forgetting those that were eliminated.",
    mecanisme: "Eliminated cases are by nature invisible: they do not testify, are not published, do not appear in rankings. The sample we observe is therefore not representative.",
