    parade: "Ask yourself: if I were starting from scratch, would I choose the current situation? Assess the default option like any other.",
    source: "Samuelson and Zeckhauser (1988). Johnson and Goldstein (2003): the rate of consent to organ donation varies by several dozen points between neighbouring countries, depending on whether consent is presumed or must be given explicitly.",
